    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Weapon Mastery Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Domino Strike.</strong> When you hit a creature with a weapon and use the Push mastery property to push it into a space occupied by a Large or smaller creature, you can make them collide. Each of them makes a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus the modifier of the ability increased by this feat and your Proficiency Bonus), taking 1d10 Bludgeoning damage on a failure.</p><p><strong>Fearless Leap.</strong> When you make a Long Jump after moving at least 10 feet immediately before it and land within 5 feet of two or more enemies, attack rolls against you have Disadvantage until the start of your next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-5oMvO6LpznQwu8LH\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The save DC uses Strength: change it to Dexterity in the activity if you increased Dexterity.</p></section>",
